# THE ONE PLACE THE PINNED BtbN FFmpeg BUILD IS WRITTEN DOWN.
#
# Read at run time by .github/actions/install-ffmpeg (every workflow's FFmpeg
# install). scripts/install.sh and Dockerfile.cuda cannot read it (one is piped
# from curl, the other is an image recipe), so they restate the 8.1 Linux values
# and internal/testenv/ffmpeg_pin_single_source_test.go fails if they differ.
# Plain KEY=value lines only: no quotes, no spaces, no variables.
#
# A hash comes from this repository, reviewed in a pull request, never from the
# release serving the file. Take it from the asset `digest` field of
#   gh api repos/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/tags/<tag>
#
# TO BUMP
#   - Pick a MONTH-END autobuild tag: BtbN keeps only the last build of each
#     month, and a daily is deleted after about two weeks (the 2026-10-29
#     404, see internal/testenv/installer_ffmpeg_pin_test.go).
#   - Replace the tag and every asset/sha256 pair below together.
#   - docs/INSTALL.md points here rather than restating a tag or hash; leave it so.
#   - Copy the 8.1 Linux values into scripts/install.sh (tag, ffmpeg_static_asset,
#     ffmpeg_static_sha256) and Dockerfile.cuda (the three ARGs).
#   - Never 9.0.0 or 9.0.1: FFmpeg commit 9d4ca2122 (a scheduler change that
#     misorders output and ends streams early, reverted in 9.0.2).
#
# The 8.1 line is what CI, the installer and the cuda image run; the 9.0 line is
# only ffmpeg-compat.yml's second leg. Latest of each checked 2026-10-31.
FFMPEG_BTBN_TAG=autobuild-2026-09-30-13-08

FFMPEG_8_1_LINUX_AMD64_ASSET=ffmpeg-n8.1.3-9-g29e619e767-linux64-gpl-8.1.tar.xz
FFMPEG_8_1_LINUX_AMD64_SHA256=97ce978979194b5cf7e06a5e68020dbdaa7a4f3294c5452b6a1bc347100dbb79
FFMPEG_8_1_LINUX_ARM64_ASSET=ffmpeg-n8.1.3-9-g29e619e767-linuxarm64-gpl-8.1.tar.xz
FFMPEG_8_1_LINUX_ARM64_SHA256=10523d1e0be6b3ce62a9708cc50815c4b5eb5f36ae147fbe2afeecda6f2d6845
FFMPEG_8_1_WINDOWS_AMD64_ASSET=ffmpeg-n8.1.3-9-g29e619e767-win64-gpl-8.1.zip
FFMPEG_8_1_WINDOWS_AMD64_SHA256=7b801cdd3a1a0bb54ae6f572187e68b4ed54f52086cfee133fab2180bfb429fa

FFMPEG_9_0_LINUX_AMD64_ASSET=ffmpeg-n9.0.2-17-g2a571b6068-linux64-gpl-9.0.tar.xz
FFMPEG_9_0_LINUX_AMD64_SHA256=68ee646831adaae2495618346f3bba94ff207ff83bbd34d643e7004730d66269
FFMPEG_9_0_LINUX_ARM64_ASSET=ffmpeg-n9.0.2-17-g2a571b6068-linuxarm64-gpl-9.0.tar.xz
FFMPEG_9_0_LINUX_ARM64_SHA256=91afcd7695d4bbbb9e0057aa10baaf9875ec4e1a97303f9059ec971336a2ab46
